{"4293970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alstan", "steam_appid": 4293970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >READ THE DEVELOPPER'S NOTE AT THE BOTTOM<br><br>In the depths of an ancient tomb buried beneath the sands of the Idnan Desert, <strong>Alstan,</strong> a young nomadic warrior, has just lost his sister to a mysterious curse: the <strong>mark of the desert</strong>, a symbol burned into the flesh of those who bear the burden of the <strong>djinn</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome with grief, Alstan crosses paths with a strange traveller. The latter reveals that behind this mark lies an ancient and feared being: <strong>Rahim</strong>, a legendary Djinn who has been confined for centuries in a forgotten temple. Driven by anger, Alstan embarks on a quest for vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alstan and set off across the Idnan desert, an arid and enchanting world inspired by <strong>Amazigh and Tuareg cultures</strong>. Along the way, face fallen spirits, ancient Djinns who have also been twisted by the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>fast-paced combat, dynamic exploration mechanics</strong> and strong art direction, Alstan offers an immersive experience in a <strong>semi-open desert world,</strong> where every step brings you closer to the truth... and revenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/6b2bb9fb807cef99bdc82f0c0001d315.avif?t=1781455063\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras_big/6b2bb9fb807cef99bdc82f0c0001d315.avif?t=1781455063 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemies blocking your path and testing your skills and endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/94afb04d7073f038cbf9fa0ee3e22eea.avif?t=1781455063\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb surfaces, slide across sand, and explore the most secret corners of the desert and its ruins to learn more about its history and find items to increase Alstan's power !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/daabe4a0fda21917c1cb1343736f5d3a.avif?t=1781455063\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAND POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the curse to your advantage by harnessing its power, delivering powerful shock waves or propelling yourself into the air. It's up to you to decide how to wield this valuable asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/af5aae83dc71ab3ca7945c317c1e15b0.avif?t=1781455063\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a vertical slice created by a team of students as part of our graduation project. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >READ THE DEVELOPPER'S NOTE AT THE BOTTOM<br><br>In the depths of an ancient tomb buried beneath the sands of the Idnan Desert, <strong>Alstan,</strong> a young nomadic warrior, has just lost his sister to a mysterious curse: the <strong>mark of the desert</strong>, a symbol burned into the flesh of those who bear the burden of the <strong>djinn</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome with grief, Alstan crosses paths with a strange traveller. The latter reveals that behind this mark lies an ancient and feared being: <strong>Rahim</strong>, a legendary Djinn who has been confined for centuries in a forgotten temple. Driven by anger, Alstan embarks on a quest for vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alstan and set off across the Idnan desert, an arid and enchanting world inspired by <strong>Amazigh and Tuareg cultures</strong>. Along the way, face fallen spirits, ancient Djinns who have also been twisted by the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>fast-paced combat, dynamic exploration mechanics</strong> and strong art direction, Alstan offers an immersive experience in a <strong>semi-open desert world,</strong> where every step brings you closer to the truth... and revenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/6b2bb9fb807cef99bdc82f0c0001d315.avif?t=1781455063\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras_big/6b2bb9fb807cef99bdc82f0c0001d315.avif?t=1781455063 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemies blocking your path and testing your skills and endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/94afb04d7073f038cbf9fa0ee3e22eea.avif?t=1781455063\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb surfaces, slide across sand, and explore the most secret corners of the desert and its ruins to learn more about its history and find items to increase Alstan's power !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/daabe4a0fda21917c1cb1343736f5d3a.avif?t=1781455063\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAND POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the curse to your advantage by harnessing its power, delivering powerful shock waves or propelling yourself into the air. It's up to you to decide how to wield this valuable asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/extras/af5aae83dc71ab3ca7945c317c1e15b0.avif?t=1781455063\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a vertical slice created by a team of students as part of our graduation project. </p>", "short_description": "Alstan is a 3rd-person action-adventure game set in the merciless deserts of Idnan, inspired by Amazigh and Tuareg cultures. You play as Alstan, a warrior cursed by the Mark of the Desert, a power that allows him to control sand but slowly turns him into one of the very Djinns he hunts.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/f68f745775f61c511b946dc428266f4da0cd589f/header.jpg?t=1781455063", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/dbc3bbeccdb4374e9bb164cf919c0a60975e3894/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781455063", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4293970/dbc3bbeccdb4374e9bb164cf919c0a60975e3894/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781455063", "website": "https://linktr.ee/Alstan?ltsid=bfeafeab-9e82-4b47-b983-526bba90389e", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory: